IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PROG-CLAWVM-WB.

DATA DIVISION.
01 CURR-VER            PIC 9(9) USAGE R0.
01 STAGED-VER          PIC 9(9) USAGE R1.
01 IS-APPEND           PIC 9(9) USAGE R2.
01 COMMITTED-ENTRIES   PIC 9(9) USAGE R3.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-CLAWVM-WB.
    MOVE 0 TO COMMITTED-ENTRIES.

    IF IS-APPEND == 1
        MOVE 1 TO COMMITTED-ENTRIES.
    ELSE
        IF STAGED-VER == CURR-VER
            MOVE 1 TO COMMITTED-ENTRIES.
        END-IF.
    END-IF.

    SET depth 3.
    WEIGHT 32 STAGED-VER.
    WEIGHT 30 COMMITTED-ENTRIES.
    EVAL.
    PRUNE 15.
    GO TO END-STRATEGY.

END-STRATEGY.
